{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a bush pilot in this minimalist open world flight sim. Do deliveries in the rapidly changing weather conditions of the remote wilderness. Upgrade your aircraft and prepare for take offs and landings on rough terrain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>simplified flight model</strong>, you can just focus on the fun parts of flying, landing and manoeuvring the aircraft. You don't need to worry about any details for handling real aircraft, like propeller reaction forces and trim tabs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are <strong>optimized for</strong>\u00a0<strong>gamepad\u00a0and keyboard + mouse</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOTAS and flight joysticks are not supported.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seed is used to generate a new <strong>procedural open world</strong> for each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your <strong>difficulty</strong>. Your game can range from a calm world where you can relax in undisturbed skies to a place where you constantly battle ever changing rain, snow, wind, turbulence and fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full size of the game is about <strong>100MB</strong> and it runs well on a beat up Dell Vostro 15 3000 from 2022.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 8 pieces of <strong>original</strong> <strong>soundtrack</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I strongly dislike generative AI, so none was used for making this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bugs and Feature Requests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please use the Community Hub for reporting bugs or requesting features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Checkpoint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4152310/6951d79dd405e5b5097080c65355ebfa75027b71.jpg"},{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4152310/d22b23a12e0c8715b97e181e7d0b0387354b12b7.jpg"},{"name":"This wasn't on the map!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4152310/b62dd35b8c5c4c8fbd3045af2d68b87b5572b156.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4152310/13eeba3ce0fb0f574d4ae562e704b2a9d28e9a54.jpg"},{"name":"STOL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4152310/df89f39dcc329d9e28a28c3cb5f4a9cd24de8e3e.jpg"},{"name":"In debt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4152310/627b90f42efa98b04feeeb39e1f5be2d0a8b9aed.jpg"},{"name":"Courier Service","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4152310/d084947b2dcbdbf04b76ce1f1f88ccf4eef77753.jpg"},{"name":"No seaplane necessary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4152310/e9d60812f947273d129473793d2bec3a0551a214.jpg"},{"name":"Heavy Metal... or whatever the cargo is","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4152310/876afa44453f22250bdf92c627b77ebcc25281eb.jpg"},{"name":"Backyard tuning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4152310/4368c4bb9c2565ce01de27a71d7122a44a0e5de2.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4152310?t=1773611851","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4152310?t=1773611851","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152310/c9de2687a09023b1418a7bbcabe252061a04446e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773611851","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152310/c9de2687a09023b1418a7bbcabe252061a04446e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773611851","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4384440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a bush pilot in this minimalist open world flight sim. Do deliveries in the rapidly changing weather conditions of the remote wilderness. Upgrade your aircraft and prepare for take offs and landings on rough terrain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>simplified flight model</strong>, you can just focus on the fun parts of flying, landing and manoeuvring the aircraft. You don't need to worry about any details for handling real aircraft, like propeller reaction forces and trim tabs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are <strong>optimized for</strong>\u00a0<strong>gamepad\u00a0and keyboard + mouse</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOTAS and flight joysticks are not supported.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seed is used to generate a new <strong>procedural open world</strong> for each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your <strong>difficulty</strong>. Your game can range from a calm world where you can relax in undisturbed skies to a place where you constantly battle ever changing rain, snow, wind, turbulence and fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full size of the game is about <strong>100MB</strong> and it runs well on a beat up Dell Vostro 15 3000 from 2022.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 8 pieces of <strong>original</strong> <strong>soundtrack</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I strongly dislike generative AI, so none was used for making this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bugs and Feature Requests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please use the Community Hub for reporting bugs or requesting features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["dimitars"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152310/04b4b37807dc6a234907db0b08aa224cc73ff21e/header.jpg?t=1773611851","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distribution released after 2018<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200, AMD FX-4100, Raspberry Pi 4<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 2500 (Ivy Bridge), AMD Radeon R5 Graphics (Kaveri)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo SU9400, Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 2500 (Ivy Bridge), AMD Radeon R5 Graphics (Kaveri)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4152310/1636783501/8434136c46d5696791e76a21ef870a2d201ed02f/1768138867/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768200354","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steams